    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454430/extras/ca2e511d4bdb0d7bca93258d8e7d62af.avif?t=1696615731\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454430/extras/73cc6c47c9956cd5e66fd9bf1051faa6.poster.avif?t=1696615731\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454430/extras/73cc6c47c9956cd5e66fd9bf1051faa6.webm?t=1696615731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454430/extras/73cc6c47c9956cd5e66fd9bf1051faa6.mp4?t=1696615731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Game synopsis</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454430/extras/4c77fea38e81cf3a83b596bf094c39a3.avif?t=1696615731\" /></span><br><br>David Fox's life is like an endless roller coaster - he works as a detective in the Delight City Police Department, enjoys authority among his police colleagues, leads a carefree lifestyle, and has a good time with girls. He is the best detective in the city and has managed to solve many seemingly hopeless cases during his career. But everything changes when a ruthless serial killer appears in the city, for whose crimes Fox will be blamed. Whether he can catch the killer and clear his reputation depends entirely on you.<br><br><strong>What makes our game exciting?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454430/extras/2f101ec9c41310dcdc0e5d0c920a464f.avif?t=1696615731\" /></span><br><br>* Each decision has its consequences.<br>* You build relationships with characters yourself.<br>* You can't save everyone.<br>* Not all characters will survive until the end of the story.<br>* Choose between the light or dark side of the hero.<br>* Hot girls await your attention.<br><br><strong>Inside Demo</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454430/extras/797ad97a3b2b718dfe4788ad0cc80b5c.avif?t=1696615731\" /></span><br><br>* Story setup.<br>* 30 minutes of gameplay.<br>* 500 Full HD renders.<br>* 11 animations.<br>* Branching storylines.<br>* A playlist that you'll put on repeat.",
